# Film corpus source PDFs — copyrighted books, ingested locally into the
# shared deep_memory corpus, never committed (6 MB, not a repo artifact).
data/film_corpus_sources/

# Per-persona RAG corpus sources — public-domain + open-access texts and any
# copyrighted book atoms, ingested locally into deep_memory (scripts/ingest_corpus.py).
# The source files stay local (like film_corpus_sources); only the MANIFEST.md
# per folder is versioned so the provenance travels with the repo.
data/corpus/**
!data/corpus/**/
!data/corpus/**/MANIFEST.md

# Claude Code tooling state (local-only, never commit)
.claude/plans/
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.claude/SESSION_STATE.md

# ChatGPT data export — ALL personal conversations (therapy, finance, etc.)
